  "title": "19 August 1961: Live: Aintree Institute, Liverpool",
  "date": "1961-08-19",
  "content": "<div class=\"ast-post-format- single-layout-1\"><div class=\"entry-content clear\" itemprop=\"text\"><p>This was the 23rd performance given by The Beatles at Aintree Institute, which was situated at Longmoor Lane in Aintree, Liverpool. <span id=\"more-12681\"></span></p><p>It was put on by Brian Kelly, who ran Beekay Promotions in Liverpool, and was the second of seven consecutive Saturday night bookings for The Beatles at the venue.</p><div data-carousel-extra=\"{&quot;blog_id&quot;:1,&quot;permalink&quot;:&quot;https://www.beatlesbible.com/1961/08/19/live-aintree-institute-liverpool-23/&quot;}\" id=\"gallery-1\" class=\"gallery galleryid-12681 gallery-columns-3 gallery-size-thumbnail\"><figure class=\"gallery-item\"><div class=\"gallery-icon portrait\">\n<a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/live/1961_aintree_institute_poster_01/\"><img decoding=\"sync\" width=\"127\" height=\"200\" src=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/1961_aintree_institute_poster_01-127x200.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"Poster for The Beatles at Liverpool's Aintree Institute, 1961\" srcset=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/1961_aintree_institute_poster_01-127x200.jpg 127w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/1961_aintree_institute_poster_01.jpg 368w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 127px) 100vw, 127px\" data-attachment-id=\"12753\" data-permalink=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/live/1961_aintree_institute_poster_01/\" data-orig-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/1961_aintree_institute_poster_01.jpg\" data-orig-size=\"368,580\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"Poster for The Beatles at Liverpool&amp;#8217;s Aintree Institute, 1961\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/1961_aintree_institute_poster_01.jpg\" fetchpriority=\"high\"></a></div></figure><figure class=\"gallery-item\"><div class=\"gallery-icon landscape\">\n<a href=\"https://www.bea